<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Takeover TCG</title>

<style>
*{
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    box-sizing:border-box;
    font-family:Arial, sans-serif;
}

body{
    background:#111;
    color:white;
}

header{
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1e1e1e,#292929);
    text-align:center;
    padding:100px 20px;
}

header h1{
    font-size:4rem;
    color:#ffb300;
    text-shadow:0 0 15px #ffb300;
}

header p{
    margin-top:15px;
    font-size:1.3rem;
    color:#ddd;
}

.cta{
    margin-top:30px;
}

.cta a{
    display:inline-block;
    padding:15px 35px;
    background:#ffb300;
    color:black;
    text-decoration:none;
    font-weight:bold;
    border-radius:8px;
    transition:0.3s;
}

.cta a:hover{
    background:#ffd54f;
    transform:scale(1.05);
}

section{
    padding:80px 10%;
}

h2{
    text-align:center;
    margin-bottom:30px;
    color:#ffb300;
}

.features{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr));
    gap:25px;
}

.card{
    background:#1e1e1e;
    padding:25px;
    border-radius:12px;
    border:1px solid #333;
}

.card h3{
    margin-bottom:10px;
    color:#ffb300;
}

.gallery{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(200px,1fr));
    gap:20px;
}

.gallery div{
    height:300px;
    background:#222;
    border:2px dashed #555;
    border-radius:12px;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    color:#888;
}

footer{
    text-align:center;
    padding:30px;
    background:#0a0a0a;
    color:#777;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <h1>TAKEOVER</h1>
    <p>Build. Conquer. Take Over.</p>

    <div class="cta">
        <a href="#about">Learn More</a>
    </div>
</header>

<section id="about">
    <h2>About The Game</h2>
    <p style="text-align:center; max-width:800px; margin:auto;">
        Takeover is a strategic trading card game where players battle for control,
        deploy powerful units, and outmaneuver opponents to dominate the battlefield.
        Build unique decks, discover rare cards, and create your own path to victory.
    </p>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>Game Features</h2>

    <div class="features">
        <div class="card">
            <h3>Custom Deckbuilding</h3>
            <p>Create powerful combinations and strategies.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>Rare Collectibles</h3>
            <p>Hunt for Ultra Rares, Foils, and Alternate Arts.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>Competitive Play</h3>
            <p>Challenge friends and become the ultimate champion.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>Growing Universe</h3>
            <p>New cards, factions, and mechanics every set.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>Card Gallery</h2>

    <div class="gallery">
        <div>Your Card Art</div>
        <div>Your Card Art</div>
        <div>Your Card Art</div>
        <div>Your Card Art</div>
    </div>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>Join The Community</h2>

    <p style="text-align:center;">
        Follow development updates, vote on future content, and be among the first
        to play Takeover.
    </p>

    <div class="cta" style="text-align:center;">
        <a href="#">Discord</a>
    </div>
</section>

<footer>
    © 2026 Takeover TCG. All Rights Reserved.
</footer>

</body>
</html>
